       回打尾部=summon 2 #90064110 | evolve: | gain_crest #10264120
  10364110 原始=12行 回打=5行; 原始尾部=grant_ability to opponent:board<Follower> Random(ctr:crest) where prop:Attack <= 4: | turn_end turn=Self: | banish $self
